OL,3,GNEWSAPolice to get #2m after fatal
OL,4,Acrash unleashes crimes
OL,5,
OL,6,FA police force is being given an extra
OL,7,F#2m to tackle serious crime after the
OL,8,Fdeath of two police officers and five
OL,9,Fyoung men in a crash unleashed a spate
OL,10,Fof crimes, the home secretary has
OL,11,Fannounced.
OL,13,FShabana Mahmood pledged the funding
OL,14,Fafter Prime Minister Andy Burnham paid
OL,15,Ftribute to the officers killed, and in
OL,16,Flight of the challenges faced by
OL,17,FCleveland Police following the seven
OL,18,Fdeaths on the A66 near Middlesbrough on
OL,19,F22 August.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,392,390,260,160,0,100
