OL,3,GNEWSAPolice to get #2m after fatal
OL,4,Acrash unleashes crimes
OL,5,
OL,6,FPC Matthew Blades and PC Tom Clough
OL,7,Fdied when a Volkswagen Passat going the
OL,8,Fwrong way on the A66 at South Bank hit
OL,9,Ftheir vehicle. The five men in the
OL,10,FVolkswagen also died.
OL,12,FThe force has since arrested 27 people
OL,13,Ffor activities linked to "serious and
OL,14,Forganised crime".
